Lists and test data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
pkg/lexicon/data (particle/ending list, property nouns, idiom frames, class
list) and pkg/config/default.json are our own work (CC0). The class list names
Wikidata QIDs (CC0).

testdata/fixture.json holds Wikidata labels, aliases, descriptions, P31 values
and statements (Wikidata, CC0 1.0) taken from an internal noun identification
test of 2026-10-31.

Lexicon sources
---------------
koparse builds its lexicon only from CC0 sources (Wikidata labels and lexemes)
and from material the GEUL project creates itself. Non-CC0 dictionaries and
analyzers (for example mecab-ko-dic, Kiwi, Standard Korean Language Dictionary)
may be used internally to measure accuracy, but none of their content is copied
into this repository. Evaluation texts (e.g. Wikipedia extracts, CC BY-SA) and
gold annotations are kept outside the repository; the evaluation tool takes
their paths as arguments.
